  "content_html": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/6ba9e439949b1214fe.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"כמובן! הנה טקסט ALT תיאורי וממוקד לתמונה:  **ALT:** איור המחולק לשלושה חלקים: בחלק העליון מדבר עם אוהל וחומת לבנים כסמל למקום ממשי; במרכז – מחשב נייד פתוח על אתר אינטרנט עם סמל גלובוס, המייצג מקום וירטואלי; ובחלק התחתון – יד לוחצת על כפתור ליד שעון עצר וברק, כסמל לפעולה מיידית &quot;על אתר&quot;.\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1536\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"320\" src=\"/assets/images/content/6ba9e439949b1214fe.png\" width=\"213\" /></a></div></h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עיון לשוני-מושגי במושג המקום: מן המדבר ועד האתר הווירטואלי</span>&nbsp;</h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וַיִּשְׁמַע הַכְּנַעֲנִי מֶלֶךְ עֲרָד יֹשֵׁב הַנֶּגֶב כִּי בָּא יִשְׂרָאֵל דֶּרֶךְ הָאֲתָרִים</span></blockquote><p data-end=\"543\" data-start=\"325\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">המילים \"אתר\", \"תור\", ו\"אלתר\" נשמעות מוכרות לכל דובר עברית. אך האם עצרנו לחשוב מה משותף להן? מה בין <strong data-end=\"437\" data-start=\"424\">אתר בנייה</strong> ל<strong data-end=\"454\" data-start=\"439\">אתר אינטרנט</strong>, בין <strong data-end=\"476\" data-start=\"460\">לתור את הארץ</strong> ל<strong data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"478\">לתור אחרי הלב</strong>? ומה הקשר, אם בכלל, ל<strong data-end=\"542\" data-start=\"517\">תגובה מיידית - על אתר</strong>?</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">במאמר זה נבחן את מושג <strong data-end=\"576\" data-start=\"567\">המקום</strong> כפי שהוא משתקף בלשון העברית - החל מהפסוקים שבפרשת <strong data-end=\"634\" data-start=\"627\">חקת</strong>, דרך ביטויים מקראיים, ועד השימושים המודרניים והווירטואליים. נעמוד על ההבדלים בין <strong data-end=\"729\" data-start=\"716\">מקום ממשי</strong>, <strong data-end=\"757\" data-start=\"731\">מקום מופשט או וירטואלי</strong>, ו<strong data-end=\"779\" data-start=\"760\">מעמד מיידי בזמן</strong>, ונציע מבט לשוני-מושגי המחבר בין העולמות</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">.</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">🧱 </span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מקום ממשי:&nbsp;</span></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;\"></p><ul style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"המגרש הפך להיות </span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">אֲתַר בְּנִיָּה</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"המשטרה </span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">אִתְּרָה</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> (מצאה את המקום של) חשודים\"</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"וַאֲרוֹן בְּרִית ה נֹסֵעַ לִפְנֵיהֶם דֶּרֶךְ שְׁלֹשֶׁת יָמִים </span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">לָתוּר</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> לָהֶם (לחפש להם מקום) מְנוּחָה\"</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"שְׁלַח לְךָ אֲנָשִׁים </span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">וְיָתֻרוּ</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> (ירגלו במקומות שונים) אֶת אֶרֶץ כְּנַעַן\"</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"החברה העמידה ספינה לרשות </span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">הַתַּיָּרִים</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\" (המטיילים ממקום למקום)</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">וְ</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">תֹר</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> וגוזל\" (עפ\"י פירוש מלבי\"ם - התֹר הנו סוג של יונה הנוסעת ממקום למקום)</span></span></li></ul><p></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">🌐 </span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מקום </span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">וירטואלי (</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">שאינו ממשי):&nbsp;</span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;\"></p><ul style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"אפשר למצוא את המידע ב</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">אֲתַר </span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">ה</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">אִינְטֶרְנֵט</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> של החברה\"</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"אני מנסה </span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">לָתוּר</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> (לחפש) אחר הזדמנויות עסקיות\"</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"אני הייתי לפניך </span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">בַּתּוֹר</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\" (רשימת המקומות של הממתינים)&nbsp;</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"ולא </span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">תָתֻרוּ</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> אחרי לבבכם ואחרי עיניכם \" (לא תִּפְנוּ אל המקום שהלב והעין מושכים אתכם)</span></span></li></ul><p></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">⚡<span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תיכף ומיד (באותו מקום/מעמד):</span></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;\"></p><ul style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"התלמידים השיבו לשאלות הבוחן </span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">עַל אֲתָר</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"לבנון תסיג את כוחותיה </span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">לְאַלְתָּר</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\"השחקן שכח את הטקסט, ו</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">אִלְתֵּר</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> באופן יצירתי\"</span></span></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">הערה:</span></span></h3><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">השורשים 'אתר' ו'תור' הם נפרדים.\nברם, תרגום אונקלוס (לפסוק שבראש הפוסט) יוצר ביניהם קשר:\nאת המילה 'אתרים' הוא מתרגם '</span></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מְאַלְּלַיָּא' שמשמעו לחפש (לתור).</span></span></div><p></p>"
}
